      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Similar but not duplicates, it's not instance based.\n\nThis is implementing the avatar performance system on remote users instead of only locally.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/vrchat-needs-better-instance-protection-against-data-collecting-bots-hexed\n\nThat one is the most similar based on the title. But they all suggest Worlds locked down based on ranking. This is adding some server side guard - I do not mean to sound like I know anything but it could perhaps reuse the block system and autoblock these people for the user based on ranks.",
