  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There's been an increase in ripping bot activity in VRChat. \n\nhttps://x.com/PersonVRC/status/2111427877006913920\n\nhttps://x.com/GabeTheSpirit/status/2112984215319163073 \n\nThis would be an easy way to stop this madness at the root, other than making it more difficult to rip the avatar from the file,\n\nVisitors would simply never download the avatar to begin with and see the default robot.  Allowing us to specify the rank would be cool, too.",
